> > I am not sure what I need to do for these methods to be usable for C# users. I would love some guidance on what I have to do for that.
>
> You'd need to implement it in modules/mono/glue/GodotSharp/GodotSharp/Core/Dictionary.cs (for both Dictionary and Dictionary<TKey, TValue>).
> cc @godotengine/dotnet for how exactly.

I would expose it as `GetAt` to match [`System.Collections.Generic.OrderedDictionary<TKey, TValue>.GetAt`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.collections.generic.ordereddictionary-2.getat#system-collections-generic-ordereddictionary-2-getat(system-int32)):

```cs
public KeyValuePair<TKey, TValue> GetAt(int index)
{
    return GetKeyValuePair(index);
}
```

And you can reuse the existing `GetKeyValuePair` method.
